    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Haleanjeeda ghadooweeda bea maheemajeanda ghaydit",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha NG'UTAMIIDA Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Eeshiina fuga Israeli, daba siisi eanean haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi bea ghadooweeda, nea gaba siisi guh gidagasa jeadaanyi, abeeda ghoang'waanyi haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi bea ghadooweeda aba badaydeanyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak haleanjeeda sisapa geadi bea ghadooweeda jea ang'waanya leabu heeda nyaawa suh: dahaabu, ea shiliingajeega ea lagheanga oomng'i ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea gulbeeda gasa gwatuudu, ea dea gasa ghwahareariit, ea dea areara ea hang'weaka bumbuni miyaasiin ea hang'weaka sisna buudeega nooga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea eaghwada lagweendiga, siyeasha oormeeda areara ea eagweega nooga, ea ghweendooda rabeangheeda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nagheeda gheaboonyanga, ea deanguurga jea eekuuyi nagheedida bea eeshteaydean ea hideeda ng'andit, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea lagheanga hang'oonyi sheayeat siguura garneliya, ea lagheanga suuk hang'oonyi sheayeat mida uhuuda shageedida bea daghatean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak abeeda gwasinnean heeda ghaydit ak gaydeabiida bugusta nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaynung' gawuurji gidaahiimdaaydi ak gisindunu haleanjeeda sean bea maheemajeanda nih gichea sinda sean.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sandakwajeanda Neajeeda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ak gaygwasin maleambooda haw sisna rabeangheeda, nea geawundaanyi gajea geatin iyeenya gil ea gidagween iyeenya, murdajeega gaygaba geatinagi gil ea gidagween iyeenya, geawundaanyi gal humng'eeda gajea geatinagi gil ea gidagween iyeenya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gidukuti aba dahaabooda miyaasiin dukuta jih ea bwadaw, ak gineaweesi ghealooda dahaabu meatkwajeega sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sina gharin ang'wan bea dahaabu ak gishuubi geeshangaaschi asang'wan, gharin iyeenya iina meatkweadaanyi ak gharin iyeenya giyiini meatkweeda niirja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gisini geedi iyeenya bea rabeangheeda, ak gidukuti aba dahaabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak giibuuti geedigiga jeeda ghunoojigiga mida meatkwajeega sandakwajeanda jea ghwasareana saawa sandakwajeanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geedusu majeegeanda gaygoobiita jeedeaba ghunoojisu bea sandakwajeandean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gajiina jeedeaba sandakwajeanji ng'asheega jea dagoonyi jea damuuwuuneey. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaysina hoorgeeda baydeayda bea dahaabooda miyaas, geawundaanyi gaygaba geatin iyeenya ea gidagween iyeenya, murdajeega gaygaba geatinagi ea gidagween iyeenya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sina geeruubaji iyeenya bea dahaabu, ak gisini dea gadiyeeda gidayda aba meadajeega sean bea huuydeanda hoorgeeda baydeayda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sina geeruubajeanjagi ak giyiini huuydeanda meatkweenagi, ak niirja giyiin huuydeanda meatkweeda niirja bea hoorgeeda baydeayda, ak gidabal ea gilagi gil sea hoorgeeda baydeayda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak geeruubajeesu gayghamiinda meang'eega ak gwadukuta hoorgeeda baydeayda aba meang'eega nyaawa, nea gheamamuunatka nyaawa gaygoofursiinyi, gheamamuunatka geeruubajeesu gaygoofuursa hoorgeeda baydeayda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gajiina hoorgeeda baydeayda uhuuda sandakwajeanda ak giyiin jeeda sandakwajeanda ng'asheega muuwuunooda jea dagoonyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gajeeroonyeena aba hoowa sea ang'iing'i ak gaydeabaloolnyi nea geandi uhuuda hoorgeeda baydeayda, aba bugusta Geeruubajeesu asiyeenya mida badayda sandakwajeanda muuwuunoodean gaydeabaloolnyi aba ng'asheega sean jea dagoonyi was digheanyeeka fuga Israeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Measeeda mukaatajeega sighadoawana ASEETA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Sina measeeda beehiida rabeangheeda geawundaanyi gaygaba geatin iyeenya, murdajeega gaygaba geatinagi, geawundaanyi gal humng'eeda gajea geatinagi gil ea gidagween iyeenya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gidukuti aba dahaabooda miyaasiin ak gineaweesi ghealooda dahaabu meatkwajeega sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gajaneaweesiina meadajeega sean beehiida ayang'da mooneeda geatinda murdajeega, ak gineaweesi beehiidida ghealooda dahaabu jea ghoah beehajeega gidaghuuta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gisini gharin ang'wan bea dahaabu, ak giyiini ghunoojigiga gujakaaschi asang'wan bea geeshangaaschi asang'wan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iina ghunoojigiga murdeeda beehiidida bea measaan ak gajeeshuup geediga jea easareana measa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gisini geediga was rabeanghajeega jea easareana measa, ak gidukuti aba dahaabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gisini giihearmajeagaaschi ea ganakwajeega jea eayiin geediga ng'andidi ea gikoombajeega ea gweerajeagaaschi jea eetalealiideawa haleanjeeni, ak gisini aba dahaabooda miyaas. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 25:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gajiina mukaateeyda giihiimnooda badayda measa bea madeedeanyu galeagasean.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.25.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.25.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Heeda siyiina gheaboonyaneeda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
